            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  $ \\underline{\\text{Reduction, Suspension and Demotion Appeals.}} $ An employee reduced in pay, demoted, or suspended shall receive written notice of the discipline with the specific charges and facts supporting the discipline.",
